CVE-2025-8732: bound SGML catalog expansion and deduplicate repeated references.

Origin: https://gitlab.gnome.org/GNOME/libxml2/-/commit/3425dece47c8db600f8d7328ae2d7ddfaa0d7b2d
Origin: https://gitlab.gnome.org/GNOME/libxml2/-/commit/4982ee83f91ed598de793b280c8990646726c440
Backport: recontextualized for upstream 2.13.9; existing ABI retained.
Uses official Debian backport contexts and upstream catalog fixtures. The follow-up prevents repeated references from expanding exponentially beneath the depth bound.

